  "title": "Cessna 172N — Normal Procedures (independently worded)",
  "description": "Demonstrates the posture the corpus should take with a type whose POH is still under copyright: capture the procedure as fact, in wording that is the contributor's own, and do not reproduce the manufacturer's text, selection or arrangement. The item sequence is the ordinary flow every 172 checklist follows; the phrasing here was written for this file. Values that are limitations have been deliberately left out rather than recalled from memory.",
