  "provenance": {
    "source": {
      "kind": "none",
      "notes": "No Cessna document was consulted or copied. Written from general familiarity with the type's normal flow. This is the reason the file carries no airspeeds, no fuel quantities and no power settings: those are limitations that must come from the aircraft's own POH, and inventing or recalling them would be the most dangerous thing this file could do. A contributor holding the POH for their aircraft is expected to fill them in and record that source."
    },
